rhp-mbfl-sys
============

This crate's own files (src/, glue/, build.rs) are licensed under
MIT OR Apache-2.0, like the rest of rhp. The vendored files under vendor/
keep their own licences, listed below. They are compiled into a static
archive; rhp ships its source, so a user can rebuild the binary against a
modified copy of the library, as LGPL-2.1 section 6 asks. The repository's
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES carries the same entries with the full licence texts.

rhp-builtins links this crate only with its `mbstring-libmbfl` feature (on
by default), and builds without it. rhp-vm, rhp-sapi and tools/rhp-difftest
use rhp-builtins' default features, so every rhp binary this workspace builds
contains libmbfl.


